OL,3,GNEWSAThe town swapping lie-ins for
OL,4,Aearly morning raves
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt's an idea that has already taken off
OL,7,Fin cities like Berlin, Sydney and New
OL,8,FYork, and now a seaside town in Suffolk
OL,9,Fhas become the latest place for people
OL,10,Fto go partying in the morning.
OL,12,FA Coffee and Clubbing event has started
OL,13,Fin Felixstowe for those who want to
OL,14,Fhave fun dancing at 09:00 without the
OL,15,Flate nights and hangovers.
OL,17,FEvent founder Vanessa Fullerton-Batten
OL,18,Fsaid she wanted to let people enjoy
OL,19,F"music that transports you back to
OL,20,Fthose heady days of the '90s club
OL,21,Fdancefloors - but in the morning".
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
